{
  "dom_id": "step-153382",
  "name": "Power Sets of Infinite Sets",
  "problem": "In this lesson, our primary focus was on power sets of *finite* sets. The definition of the power set of an *infinite* set mirrors that of finite sets. Namely, it comprises all possible subsets.\n\nAs we already understand, for finite sets, the size of power sets grows exponentially based on the size of the underlying set: \n\n$$\n\\big| \\mathcal{P}(X) \\big| = 2^{|X|}\n$$\n\nWhen dealing with power sets of infinite sets, the situation is more intricate. \n\nFor example, let's consider $\\mathbb{R}^2,$ the set containing all points on the Cartesian plane. What are the elements of the power set $\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R^2)?$\n\nAny collection of points on the plane is a subset of $\\mathbb R^2.$ Such subsets can be visualized as black-and-white images on the plane, where points belonging to the subset are drawn in black, and points not belonging to the subset are represented in white.\n\nFor instance, each of the following images gives us a specific element of $\\mathcal{P}(\\mathbb{R}^2){:}$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14180007/assets/bbdb49640183563e0cb137b3c57095edd8b81bceac4dcda1bf3460371df17930.png)\n\nIt follows that any text, be it any or all existing Math Academy lessons, those planned for the future, or any other possible text (finite or infinite), including those not yet written, are all contained within $\\mathcal{P}(\\mathbb{R}^2).$ \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14180007/assets/c47487cf1a7253bfafd5419cd824df30669a575d4b90f3fddc36566e920325bc.png)\n\nIt's somewhat extraordinary that such a vast and important set can be expressed using just the symbols $\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R^2).$",
  "worked_solution": "",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-153382\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"153382\" steptype=\"tutorial\" contentid=\"8512\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-153382\" class=\"stepAnchor\" name=\"step-18\">Power Sets of Infinite Sets</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"153382\">?</div>\n            </div> \n\n            <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>In this lesson, our primary focus was on power sets of <em>finite</em> sets. The definition of the power set of an <em>infinite</em> set mirrors that of finite sets. Namely, it comprises all possible subsets.</p>\n<p>As we already understand, for finite sets, the size of power sets grows exponentially based on the size of the underlying set: </p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"13.595ex\" height=\"3.509ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -1.005ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1078.4 5853.2 1510.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n\\big| \\mathcal{P}(X) \\big| = 2^{|X|}\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-7C\" d=\"M139 -249H137Q125 -249 119 -235V251L120 737Q130 750 139 750Q152 750 159 735V-235Q151 -249 141 -249H139Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-2223\" d=\"M139 -249H137Q125 -249 119 -235V251L120 737Q130 750 139 750Q152 750 159 735V-235Q151 -249 141 -249H139Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJCAL-50\" d=\"M37 475Q19 475 19 487Q19 536 103 604T327 682Q329 682 344 682T380 682T421 683H463Q625 683 695 615Q718 591 726 564Q733 547 733 525Q733 412 607 312T321 205H312Q293 205 293 217Q293 224 302 236T333 260T385 274Q558 287 614 407Q633 445 633 477Q633 515 612 543T556 585T481 607T399 614H370L368 603Q352 463 312 312T242 82T202 -13Q190 -33 164 -45T121 -57Q108 -57 108 -45Q108 -40 120 -10T151 73T192 190T233 349T266 539Q267 546 269 565T272 598T274 613H270Q209 613 163 588Q131 572 113 518Q102 502 80 490T37 475Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-28\" d=\"M94 250Q94 319 104 381T127 488T164 576T202 643T244 695T277 729T302 750H315H319Q333 750 333 741Q333 738 316 720T275 667T226 581T184 443T167 250T184 58T225 -81T274 -167T316 -220T333 -241Q333 -250 318 -250H315H302L274 -226Q180 -141 137 -14T94 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMATHI-58\" d=\"M42 0H40Q26 0 26 11Q26 15 29 27Q33 41 36 43T55 46Q141 49 190 98Q200 108 306 224T411 342Q302 620 297 625Q288 636 234 637H206Q200 643 200 645T202 664Q206 677 212 683H226Q260 681 347 681Q380 681 408 681T453 682T473 682Q490 682 490 671Q490 670 488 658Q484 643 481 640T465 637Q434 634 411 620L488 426L541 485Q646 598 646 610Q646 628 622 635Q617 635 609 637Q594 637 594 648Q594 650 596 664Q600 677 606 683H618Q619 683 643 683T697 681T738 680Q828 680 837 683H845Q852 676 852 672Q850 647 840 637H824Q790 636 763 628T722 611T698 593L687 584Q687 585 592 480L505 384Q505 383 536 304T601 142T638 56Q648 47 699 46Q734 46 734 37Q734 35 732 23Q728 7 725 4T711 1Q708 1 678 1T589 2Q528 2 496 2T461 1Q444 1 444 10Q444 11 446 25Q448 35 450 39T455 44T464 46T480 47T506 54Q523 62 523 64Q522 64 476 181L429 299Q241 95 236 84Q232 76 232 72Q232 53 261 47Q262 47 267 47T273 46Q276 46 277 46T280 45T283 42T284 35Q284 26 282 19Q279 6 276 4T261 1Q258 1 243 1T201 2T142 2Q64 2 42 0Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-29\" d=\"M60 749L64 750Q69 750 74 750H86L114 726Q208 641 251 514T294 250Q294 182 284 119T261 12T224 -76T186 -143T145 -194T113 -227T90 -246Q87 -249 86 -250H74Q66 -250 63 -250T58 -247T55 -238Q56 -237 66 -225Q221 -64 221 250T66 725Q56 737 55 738Q55 746 60 749Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-3D\" d=\"M56 347Q56 360 70 367H707Q722 359 722 347Q722 336 708 328L390 327H72Q56 332 56 347ZM56 153Q56 168 72 173H708Q722 163 722 153Q722 140 707 133H70Q56 140 56 153Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-32\" d=\"M109 429Q82 429 66 447T50 491Q50 562 103 614T235 666Q326 666 387 610T449 465Q449 422 429 383T381 315T301 241Q265 210 201 149L142 93L218 92Q375 92 385 97Q392 99 409 186V189H449V186Q448 183 436 95T421 3V0H50V19V31Q50 38 56 46T86 81Q115 113 136 137Q145 147 170 174T204 211T233 244T261 278T284 308T305 340T320 369T333 401T340 431T343 464Q343 527 309 573T212 619Q179 619 154 602T119 569T109 550Q109 549 114 549Q132 549 151 535T170 489Q170 464 154 447T109 429Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<g transform=\"translate(0,850)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2223\" x=\"0\" y=\"-751\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2223\" x=\"0\" y=\"-950\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJCAL-50\" x=\"278\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"1012\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-58\" x=\"1401\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"2254\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(2643,0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(0,850)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2223\" x=\"0\" y=\"-751\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2223\" x=\"0\" y=\"-950\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"3199\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(4256,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(500,412)\">\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-7C\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-58\" x=\"278\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-7C\" x=\"1131\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>When dealing with power sets of infinite sets, the situation is more intricate. </p>\n<p>For example, let's consider <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"3.379ex\" height=\"3.009ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1006.6 1454.9 1295.7\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\\mathbb{R}^2,</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJAMS-52\" d=\"M17 665Q17 672 28 683H221Q415 681 439 677Q461 673 481 667T516 654T544 639T566 623T584 607T597 592T607 578T614 565T618 554L621 548Q626 530 626 497Q626 447 613 419Q578 348 473 326L455 321Q462 310 473 292T517 226T578 141T637 72T686 35Q705 30 705 16Q705 7 693 -1H510Q503 6 404 159L306 310H268V183Q270 67 271 59Q274 42 291 38Q295 37 319 35Q344 35 353 28Q362 17 353 3L346 -1H28Q16 5 16 16Q16 35 55 35Q96 38 101 52Q106 60 106 341T101 632Q95 645 55 648Q17 648 17 665ZM241 35Q238 42 237 45T235 78T233 163T233 337V621L237 635L244 648H133Q136 641 137 638T139 603T141 517T141 341Q141 131 140 89T134 37Q133 36 133 35H241ZM457 496Q457 540 449 570T425 615T400 634T377 643Q374 643 339 648Q300 648 281 635Q271 628 270 610T268 481V346H284Q327 346 375 352Q421 364 439 392T457 496ZM492 537T492 496T488 427T478 389T469 371T464 361Q464 360 465 360Q469 360 497 370Q593 400 593 495Q593 592 477 630L457 637L461 626Q474 611 488 561Q492 537 492 496ZM464 243Q411 317 410 317Q404 317 401 315Q384 315 370 312H346L526 35H619L606 50Q553 109 464 243Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-32\" d=\"M109 429Q82 429 66 447T50 491Q50 562 103 614T235 666Q326 666 387 610T449 465Q449 422 429 383T381 315T301 241Q265 210 201 149L142 93L218 92Q375 92 385 97Q392 99 409 186V189H449V186Q448 183 436 95T421 3V0H50V19V31Q50 38 56 46T86 81Q115 113 136 137Q145 147 170 174T204 211T233 244T261 278T284 308T305 340T320 369T333 401T340 431T343 464Q343 527 309 573T212 619Q179 619 154 602T119 569T109 550Q109 549 114 549Q132 549 151 535T170 489Q170 464 154 447T109 429Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-2C\" d=\"M78 35T78 60T94 103T137 121Q165 121 187 96T210 8Q210 -27 201 -60T180 -117T154 -158T130 -185T117 -194Q113 -194 104 -185T95 -172Q95 -168 106 -156T131 -126T157 -76T173 -3V9L172 8Q170 7 167 6T161 3T152 1T140 0Q113 0 96 17Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJAMS-52\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"1021\" y=\"581\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"1176\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> the set containing all points on the Cartesian plane. What are the elements of the power set <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"7.343ex\" height=\"3.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1006.6 3161.4 1367.4\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R^2)?</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJCAL-50\" d=\"M37 475Q19 475 19 487Q19 536 103 604T327 682Q329 682 344 682T380 682T421 683H463Q625 683 695 615Q718 591 726 564Q733 547 733 525Q733 412 607 312T321 205H312Q293 205 293 217Q293 224 302 236T333 260T385 274Q558 287 614 407Q633 445 633 477Q633 515 612 543T556 585T481 607T399 614H370L368 603Q352 463 312 312T242 82T202 -13Q190 -33 164 -45T121 -57Q108 -57 108 -45Q108 -40 120 -10T151 73T192 190T233 349T266 539Q267 546 269 565T272 598T274 613H270Q209 613 163 588Q131 572 113 518Q102 502 80 490T37 475Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-28\" d=\"M94 250Q94 319 104 381T127 488T164 576T202 643T244 695T277 729T302 750H315H319Q333 750 333 741Q333 738 316 720T275 667T226 581T184 443T167 250T184 58T225 -81T274 -167T316 -220T333 -241Q333 -250 318 -250H315H302L274 -226Q180 -141 137 -14T94 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJAMS-52\" d=\"M17 665Q17 672 28 683H221Q415 681 439 677Q461 673 481 667T516 654T544 639T566 623T584 607T597 592T607 578T614 565T618 554L621 548Q626 530 626 497Q626 447 613 419Q578 348 473 326L455 321Q462 310 473 292T517 226T578 141T637 72T686 35Q705 30 705 16Q705 7 693 -1H510Q503 6 404 159L306 310H268V183Q270 67 271 59Q274 42 291 38Q295 37 319 35Q344 35 353 28Q362 17 353 3L346 -1H28Q16 5 16 16Q16 35 55 35Q96 38 101 52Q106 60 106 341T101 632Q95 645 55 648Q17 648 17 665ZM241 35Q238 42 237 45T235 78T233 163T233 337V621L237 635L244 648H133Q136 641 137 638T139 603T141 517T141 341Q141 131 140 89T134 37Q133 36 133 35H241ZM457 496Q457 540 449 570T425 615T400 634T377 643Q374 643 339 648Q300 648 281 635Q271 628 270 610T268 481V346H284Q327 346 375 352Q421 364 439 392T457 496ZM492 537T492 496T488 427T478 389T469 371T464 361Q464 360 465 360Q469 360 497 370Q593 400 593 495Q593 592 477 630L457 637L461 626Q474 611 488 561Q492 537 492 496ZM464 243Q411 317 410 317Q404 317 401 315Q384 315 370 312H346L526 35H619L606 50Q553 109 464 243Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-32\" d=\"M109 429Q82 429 66 447T50 491Q50 562 103 614T235 666Q326 666 387 610T449 465Q449 422 429 383T381 315T301 241Q265 210 201 149L142 93L218 92Q375 92 385 97Q392 99 409 186V189H449V186Q448 183 436 95T421 3V0H50V19V31Q50 38 56 46T86 81Q115 113 136 137Q145 147 170 174T204 211T233 244T261 278T284 308T305 340T320 369T333 401T340 431T343 464Q343 527 309 573T212 619Q179 619 154 602T119 569T109 550Q109 549 114 549Q132 549 151 535T170 489Q170 464 154 447T109 429Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-29\" d=\"M60 749L64 750Q69 750 74 750H86L114 726Q208 641 251 514T294 250Q294 182 284 119T261 12T224 -76T186 -143T145 -194T113 -227T90 -246Q87 -249 86 -250H74Q66 -250 63 -250T58 -247T55 -238Q56 -237 66 -225Q221 -64 221 250T66 725Q56 737 55 738Q55 746 60 749Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-3F\" d=\"M226 668Q190 668 162 656T124 632L114 621Q116 621 119 620T130 616T145 607T157 591T162 567Q162 544 147 529T109 514T71 528T55 566Q55 625 100 661T199 704Q201 704 210 704T224 705H228Q281 705 320 692T378 656T407 612T416 567Q416 503 361 462Q267 395 247 303Q242 279 242 241V224Q242 205 239 202T222 198T205 201T202 218V249Q204 320 220 371T255 445T292 491T315 537Q317 546 317 574V587Q317 604 315 615T304 640T277 661T226 668ZM162 61Q162 89 180 105T224 121Q247 119 264 104T281 61Q281 31 264 16T222 1Q197 1 180 16T162 61Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJCAL-50\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"733\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(1123,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJAMS-52\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"1021\" y=\"581\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"2299\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-3F\" x=\"2688\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>Any collection of points on the plane is a subset of <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"3.379ex\" height=\"2.676ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1006.6 1454.9 1152.1\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\\mathbb R^2.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJAMS-52\" d=\"M17 665Q17 672 28 683H221Q415 681 439 677Q461 673 481 667T516 654T544 639T566 623T584 607T597 592T607 578T614 565T618 554L621 548Q626 530 626 497Q626 447 613 419Q578 348 473 326L455 321Q462 310 473 292T517 226T578 141T637 72T686 35Q705 30 705 16Q705 7 693 -1H510Q503 6 404 159L306 310H268V183Q270 67 271 59Q274 42 291 38Q295 37 319 35Q344 35 353 28Q362 17 353 3L346 -1H28Q16 5 16 16Q16 35 55 35Q96 38 101 52Q106 60 106 341T101 632Q95 645 55 648Q17 648 17 665ZM241 35Q238 42 237 45T235 78T233 163T233 337V621L237 635L244 648H133Q136 641 137 638T139 603T141 517T141 341Q141 131 140 89T134 37Q133 36 133 35H241ZM457 496Q457 540 449 570T425 615T400 634T377 643Q374 643 339 648Q300 648 281 635Q271 628 270 610T268 481V346H284Q327 346 375 352Q421 364 439 392T457 496ZM492 537T492 496T488 427T478 389T469 371T464 361Q464 360 465 360Q469 360 497 370Q593 400 593 495Q593 592 477 630L457 637L461 626Q474 611 488 561Q492 537 492 496ZM464 243Q411 317 410 317Q404 317 401 315Q384 315 370 312H346L526 35H619L606 50Q553 109 464 243Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-32\" d=\"M109 429Q82 429 66 447T50 491Q50 562 103 614T235 666Q326 666 387 610T449 465Q449 422 429 383T381 315T301 241Q265 210 201 149L142 93L218 92Q375 92 385 97Q392 99 409 186V189H449V186Q448 183 436 95T421 3V0H50V19V31Q50 38 56 46T86 81Q115 113 136 137Q145 147 170 174T204 211T233 244T261 278T284 308T305 340T320 369T333 401T340 431T343 464Q343 527 309 573T212 619Q179 619 154 602T119 569T109 550Q109 549 114 549Q132 549 151 535T170 489Q170 464 154 447T109 429Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102